Dundubhi,
(1) f., n. of a ‘gandharva maid’: Kv 〔4.21〕;
(2) m., n. of a nāga king: Māy 〔247.16〕.

Dundubhisvara,
(1) n. of a former Buddha: LV 〔171.11〕;
(2) (the same? cf. also next, and ˚svara-rāja), n. of a Buddha in the north: Suv 〔2.5〕; 〔8.2〕; 〔120.7〕;
(3) n. of a gandharva king: Kv 〔2.17〕;
(4) n. of a Śākyan youth: Av 〔i.371.1 ff.〕
